                "title": "Classico Collection Ornate Leverset",
                "description": "Omnia 309RE, Ornate Leverset - This Ornate Door Lever made by Omnia brings together beautiful detailing and quality craftsmanship. The Ornate Leverset is available in Florentine Brass, Siena Brass, Etruscan bronze, and Venetian Bronze finishes. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions for 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch thick doors with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
